//
// Phi-4-mini Q4NX prefill compile-only smoke test: builds the prefill ELFs
// (rms_gemms_rope with the partial-rotary rope_partial leaf, flash_attn, o_ffn,
// and the 13-partition lm_head GEMV) through the AIR -> AIE -> aiecc -> Peano
// pipeline. No NPU dispatch, no weight download (the kernels are weight-free;
// Q4NX only changes the host weight source).
//
// Deliberately does NOT require llvm_link_pre23: the prefill has no inline-attn
// merge, so this gate stays unconditional. The decode templates, which do need
// that llvm-link, are gated separately by run_npu2_compile_decode.lit -- same
// split as qwen25_3b_q4.
//
// Collected by `check-programming-examples-llms-compile`, which filters on the path
// `llms/.*/run_npu2_compile` (not on a "peano" filename), like every other model.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_peano_compile
// RUN: cd test_peano_compile
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: Compilation passed.
